      },
      "text": "## Loops and Homotopy"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md#005",
      "path": [
        "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:06-fundamental-group, git-history:topology:06-fundamental-group]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "current_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:fundamental-group",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fundamental Group",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nLOOP at x₀ ∈ X:\n  γ: [0,1] → X continuous with γ(0) = γ(1) = x₀."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md#006",
      "path": [
        "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:06-fundamental-group, git-history:topology:06-fundamental-group]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "current_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:fundamental-group",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fundamental Group",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HOMOTOPY (RELATIVE TO ENDPOINTS):\n  Two loops γ, δ at x₀ are homotopic (γ ≃ δ rel x₀) if:\n  ∃H: [0,1]×[0,1] → X continuous with:\n    H(t,0) = γ(t), H(t,1) = δ(t)  (start and end are γ and δ)\n    H(0,s) = H(1,s) = x₀  (basepoint fixed throughout)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:06-fundamental-group, git-history:topology:06-fundamental-group]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "current_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:fundamental-group",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fundamental Group",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Think: H(t,s) is a continuous family of loops, s ∈ [0,1] is the \"time\" of deformation."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md#008",
      "path": [
        "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:06-fundamental-group, git-history:topology:06-fundamental-group]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "current_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:fundamental-group",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fundamental Group",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONCATENATION:\n  (γ * δ)(t) = γ(2t) for t ∈ [0,1/2]\n               δ(2t-1) for t ∈ [1/2,1]\n  First traverse γ at double speed, then δ at double speed.\n  Well-defined up to homotopy."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md#009",
      "path": [
        "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:06-fundamental-group, git-history:topology:06-fundamental-group]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "current_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:fundamental-group",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fundamental Group",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONSTANT LOOP: cₓ₀(t) = x₀ for all t. The identity element.\nREVERSE LOOP: γ̄(t) = γ(1-t). The inverse element."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md#010",
      "path": [
        "06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:06-fundamental-group, git-history:topology:06-fundamental-group]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "current_path": "topology/06-FUNDAMENTAL-GROUP.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:fundamental-group",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fundamental, group]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fundamental Group",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "π₁(X, x₀) = {[γ] : γ loops at x₀} with operation [γ][δ] = [γ * δ].\nThis is a group (associativity up to homotopy, identity = [cₓ₀], inverse = [γ̄]).\n```"
    },
