      "text": "```\nTorus T² = S¹ × S¹.\nπ₁(S¹ × S¹) = π₁(S¹) × π₁(S¹) = Z × Z.\n(Product formula: π₁(X×Y) = π₁(X) × π₁(Y) for path-connected spaces.)"
